    "message": "feat(providers): add xai, together, deepinfra, siliconflow, nebius, chutes, featherless\n\nSeven B-class providers ported from upstream. These need the model-listing machinery\nported earlier (OpenAIModelListing/pagination), now wired through their profiles:\n\n- xai (Grok) — /language-models list with aliases_field\n- together — /models list filtered by type=chat, reasoning_delta_field=reasoning\n- deepinfra — full-URL /models/list with id_field=model_name, tags->thinking\n- siliconflow — /models list filtered by sub_type=chat\n- nebius — /models verbose list filtered by architecture.modality=text->text\n- chutes — /models list filtered by required_sequence_items (text/tools)\n- featherless — paginated /models list (OpenAIModelPagination)\n\nAlso ports the _MINIMAL_TO_XHIGH effort tuple (was missing; needed by nebius).\n\nVerification: full suite 3942 passed / 6 pre-existing PS-installer failures (baseline\nunchanged); ruff format/check + ty clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
